  "notes": "Gemini pack for Keyholder v0.1 (CONTRACT section 7, auth-key model only). Native mode uses the x-goog-api-key header only; '?key=' is never used (proxy enforces). Paid inference (generateContent, streamGenerateContent, embed) is write class with spend flagged -- spend limits here are spend alerts (estimated), never exact caps. Interactions API, batch jobs, Live API, managed agents, remote MCP and fileSearchStores creation are denied (server-side state the broker cannot police). cachedContent creation is denied; fileData.fileUri references inside allowed calls are denied unless the URI is in the session creation ledger (engine parameter). Upload paths are denied in v0.1. URL-context provider-side fetching is denied via the generateContent body schema.",
